  <section id="before-you-book" class="before-book" aria-labelledby="before-you-book-heading">
    <div class="before-book__intro">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">First-Timer Planning</span>
      <h2 id="before-you-book-heading">Before You Book</h2>
      <p>Use this checklist to cover the practical questions that can affect your trip, your room choice, and your booking decision. Policies, schedules, availability, and inclusions can change, so confirm the current details before you pay.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="before-book__grid">
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Age Requirement</h3><p>Desire and this guide are for guests 21 and older. Review the current age requirement before booking.</p><a href="/legal/#terms">Review the age policy &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Passport &amp; Travel Documents</h3><p>Travel-document requirements depend on your citizenship, itinerary, and current government rules. Check the requirements that apply to your trip before departure.</p></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Airport Transfers</h3><p>Plan how you will travel between Canc&uacute;n International Airport and the resort. Desire currently identifies Original Transfers as its official transfer partner.</p><a href="#transfer">Review transfer options &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Resort Location</h3><p>Compare Riviera Maya and Pearl by location, property layout, accommodations, dining, and programming before choosing where to stay.</p><a href="/compare/">Compare the resorts &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>What Is Included?</h3><p>Inclusions can vary by resort, room category, service, and booking terms. Check the current details for the specific stay you are considering.</p><a href="/dining/">Review dining</a> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <a href="/rooms/">rooms</a> <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <a href="/services/">services</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Room Categories</h3><p>Compare the current category, view, layout, private water feature, location, and listed services before paying for an upgrade.</p><a href="/rooms/">Compare rooms &amp; suites &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Dining Reservations</h3><p>Restaurant reservation requirements and dress codes can vary by venue and change over time. Review the current restaurant information before your stay.</p><a href="/dining/">Review dining information &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Theme-Night Schedules</h3><p>Theme nights are useful for packing, but schedules can change. Use the current published schedule as a planning reference.</p><a href="/theme-nights/">Review theme nights &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Photography &amp; Privacy</h3><p>Review the published photography rules and the practical etiquette around other guests' privacy before you arrive.</p><a href="/legal/">Review photography policy &rarr;</a></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Cancellation &amp; Changes</h3><p>Cancellation, modification, deposit, and refund terms can depend on the booking channel and rate. Read the terms attached to your specific reservation before paying.</p></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Travel Insurance</h3><p>Consider coverage for the risks that matter to your trip, including cancellation, interruption, medical needs, and travel delays. Review the policy terms before purchasing.</p></article>
      <article class="before-book__card"><h3>Confirm Current Information</h3><p>Room details, dining policies, theme schedules, services, and other operational information can change. Confirm important details with the resort or booking provider before travel.</p><a href="/first-time/">Return to the first-timer guide &rarr;</a></article>
    </div>
    <p class="before-book__note"><strong>Independent guide:</strong> This checklist is planning guidance, not a substitute for the current terms, policies, and requirements that apply to your reservation.</p>
  </section>

  <article id="spa" class="service-block">
    <h2>Spa</h2>
    <p>Pearl's spa, Allure, and its counterpart at Riviera Maya both typically offer a full treatment menu for an additional fee: relaxing, deep-tissue, hot stone, and aromatherapy massages, facials, and body treatments, plus a couples massage if you want to share the experience. The steam room and sauna are generally included in your stay either way, a nice way to unwind even on a day you skip a treatment. Loyalty members may receive a discount, often in the 5 to 10 percent range depending on tier, though loyalty benefits can change&mdash;confirm current terms before you book.</p>
  </article>

  <article id="gym" class="service-block">
    <h2>Gym & Activities</h2>
    <p>A fitness center is generally included at both resorts at no extra fee, along with yoga classes and a rotating schedule of pool and beach activities like water volleyball and non-motorized water sports. Offerings can vary by resort and change over time. None of it is mandatory, it's there if a change of pace sounds good.</p>
  </article>

  <article id="transfer" class="service-block">
    <h2>Airport Transfer</h2>
    <p>Desire currently identifies <strong>Original Transfers</strong> as its official airport-transfer partner, bookable through the resort's own <a href="https://www.desire-experience.com/transfer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">airport transfer page</a>. A few independent providers are also worth considering for getting between Canc&uacute;n International Airport and the resort:</p>
    <ul class="provider-list">
      <li><strong><a href="https://sarmezcancunshuttle.com/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sarmez Shuttle Service</a></strong> &mdash; private, air-conditioned transfers for private, air-conditioned transfers.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://canadatransfers.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada Transfers</a></strong> &mdash; a good option if you're flying in from Canada.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://usa-transfers.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA Transfers</a></strong> &mdash; an independent transfer option for travelers flying in from the US.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Booking ahead is the easiest way to arrange it, rather than sorting out a taxi on arrival.</p>
  </article>

  <article id="photography" class="service-block">
    <h2>Provoke Photography</h2>
    <p>Provoke is the resorts' official photography partner. Sessions can be booked directly through <a href="https://www.provokephotos-desire.com/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their site</a> once you know your travel dates.</p>
  </article>


